 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The first time Nora saw the girl, she was standing across the street.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Smiling.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "The next morning, she was outside Nora's classroom.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Same smile.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Same clothes.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "And she never blinked.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Nora called the police.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "But on the security cameras, the girl wasn't there.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Every recording showed Nora standing alone.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Smiling at herself.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "That night, Nora locked every door.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "At 3 AM, her phone rang.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.1,
   "speak": "At three A.M., her phone rang."
  },
  {
   "text": "The caller ID said MOM.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.1,
   "speak": "The caller I.D. said, Mom."
  },
  {
   "text": "But her mother was asleep beside her.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Nora answered.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "“Why are you pretending you don't remember me?”",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.85,
   "voice": "girl",
   "fx": "phone",
   "speak": "Why are you pretending you don't remember me?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Someone knocked on the bedroom window.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Nora lived on the third floor.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "text": "She slowly pulled back the curtain.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Her phone camera opened by itself.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.6
  },
  {
   "text": "On the screen, the smiling girl stood directly behind her.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Nora spun around.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "The room was empty.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Her phone buzzed again.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "A photograph appeared.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Two little girls holding hands.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.1
  },
  {
   "text": "One was Nora.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.2
  },
  {
   "text": "The other had no face.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Underneath were four words.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
